{"id":"n54144-1-9","stage":4,"title":"뜸하다 · 消停","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54144-1-9-1","ko":"너 요즘 왜 연락이 뜸해?","zh":"你最近怎么联系我这么少啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"연락이","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락이","audio":"/audio/5939c757dc359a5f6c8a.mp3"}},{"text":"뜸해?","meaning":"消停，稀少，稀疏","explanation":"뜸하다：消停，稀少，稀疏；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뜸하다","audio":"/audio/d7db5e4a7f8ac9a9c6fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54144","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜸하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜸해","audio":"/audio/9e3baec1661d2aebd7b9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd